// input: emitted
// name and next split on every constructor of Colour, so neither match
// has a default region. Only name is labelled, so the check does not
// depend on the order Emit writes the functions in; next is the same
// split.
// CHECK-LABEL: idr.func @Main.name(
// CHECK: match
// CHECK-NOT: default
// CHECK: } loc("Main.name"(
